WEBVTT

00:14:28.488 --> 00:14:30.741
contro il male vero.

00:14:30.991 --> 00:14:32.618
O si vince o si perde.

00:14:34.411 --> 00:14:37.748
E allora dobbiamo combattere.

00:14:38.457 --> 00:14:41.835
E allora dobbiamo vincere.

00:14:42.169 --> 00:14:43.921
(In ucraino) Slava Ukraïni!

00:14:43.921 --> 00:14:45.297
Gloria all’Ucraina.

00:14:45.631 --> 00:14:46.965
Gloria alla libertà.

00:14:47.007 --> 00:14:48.216
Grazie.

00:14:48.216 --> 00:14:55.098
(Applausi)